{"title":"Grave Rivet","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Monster drop: Virikh, Virikh Templar</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>What it’s for</h2><p>Every gem transmuter has a <b>Reagent</b> tab, the Dark Witch included. This reagent and <b>500 gold</b> get you a gem of a random kind of <b>1c, 1.5c or 2c</b>. Monsters no longer drop reagents.</p><p class=\"muted\">See <a href=\"#/guide/reagents\">Reagents</a>.</p>\n      <h2>How to get it</h2>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <div style=\"margin-top:10px\"><b>Recorded monster drops</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"virikh\" title=\"Virikh - dropped it in 3 of 197 looted corpses (1/66)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/a4dbed39ea4505123159.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Virikh</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/66<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink elite\" data-monster=\"virikh-templar\" title=\"Virikh Templar - dropped it in 3 of 217 looted corpses (1/72)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/7c6325d168ea4e24bc71.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Virikh Templar</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/72<br>×1</span></div></div><div class=\"s muted\" style=\"margin-top:6px\">Drop rate as 1/X (about 1 kill in X drops it, counted over the corpses of each monster whose loot was recorded), and ×N, how many come in one drop.</div></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"item\" data-map-id=\"grave-rivet\">Show where to get it on the map</button>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic \"><img src=\"data/img/d3bf2a9071ade7fa858b.svg\" alt=\"Grave Rivet\"></div><h3>Grave Rivet</h3><table>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <tr><th>Dropped by</th><td>2 monsters</td></tr>\n      \n      \n      <tr><th>Last seen</th><td>10/29/2026, 7:33:38 PM</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}